# Bench output lives here, not in /var/log.
#
# Everything a run produces -- journal snapshots, context files and the
# STM32 RX captures -- lands in this directory so one folder holds the whole
# run and can be archived or handed over as it is.
#
# The contents are not tracked: they are per-run evidence, often megabytes,
# and belong in a report or a docs/captures/ tarball when they matter.

*
!.gitignore
!README.md
